msgstr "Allowed types:"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:101
msgid ""
"WORKING - рабочий день. Имеет смысл указывать, когда выходной день "
"становится рабочим"
msgstr ""
"WORKING - working day. Makes sense to specify when a day off becomes a "
"working day"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:102
msgid "HOLIDAY - праздник"
msgstr "HOLIDAY - holiday"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:103
msgid "SHORTDAY - сокращенный на 1ч рабочий день"
msgstr "SHORTDAY - shortened by 1 hour working day"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:104
msgid "WEEKEND - выходной"
msgstr "WEEKEND - day off"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:105
msgid "NON_WORKING - не рабочий день"
msgstr "NON_WORKING - non-working day"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:107
msgid "**description**"
msgstr "**description**"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:108
msgid "Описание дня или диапазона"
msgstr "Description of the day or range"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:112
msgid "Рабочее расписание"
msgstr "Work Schedule"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:114
msgid "Определяет обычный распорядок рабочих дней."
msgstr "Defines the regular routine of working days."

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:116
msgid ""
"Настройка расположена в журнале **\"Рабочее расписание\" (Раздел "
"администратора - Модель)**  ``v2/journals?journalId=type$working-"
"schedule&viewMode=table&ws=admin$workspace``"
msgstr ""
"The setting is located in the **\"Work Schedule\" journal (Administrator "
"Section - Model)**  ``v2/journals?journalId=type$working-"
"schedule&viewMode=table&ws=admin$workspace``"

#: ../../introduction/functions/work_calendar.rst:129
msgid ""
"Указать **Имя**, **Тип расписания** (на данный момент поддерживается "
"только weekly), **Начало и завершение рабочего дня**, **Часовой пояс** "
"(при необходимости), **Рабочие дни**, **Производственный календарь**."
msgstr ""
"Specify **Name**, **Schedule type** (currently only weekly is supported),"
" **Start and end of the working day**, **Time zone** (if necessary), "
"**Working days**, **Production calendar**."

